\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\fs24 276r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 Eugenius IV., papa}}\plain \f3\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretum de legitimitate et oecumenitate concilii Ferrariensis}}\plain \f3\fs24  (09.04.1438).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Copia bulle lecte in sessione generali.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17  Eugenius seruus seruorum dei ad perpetuam rei memoriam}}\plain \f3\fs24 . Magnasque omnipotenti Deo gratias referre nos convenit, qui antique miserationis sue non immemor ecclesiam suam fecundioribus semper accumulat incrementis ... - ... Datum Ferrarie in generali sessione sinodali sollemniter [gestrichen: celebrata] in ecclesia maiori Ferariensi celebrata, anno incarnacionis dominice Millesimo quadringentesimo trigesimo octauo, quinto ydus Aprilis, pontificatus nostri anno octauo. Druck: Georg Hofmann (Hg.), Epistolae pontificae ad Concilium Florentinum spectantes, Pars II: Epistolae pontificae de rebus in Concilo Florentino annis 1438-1439 gestis (Concilium Florentinum documenta et scriptores, Series A), Rom 1940, Nr. 135, S. 21-23.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\fs24 276r-v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 Responsio}}\plain \f3\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 papae Eugenii IV.}}\plain \f3\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 ad}}\plain \f3\fs24  petitionem electorum imperii pro danda ecclesiae pace (28.05.1438).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Sequitur responsum domini Eugenii super scripta universitatis studii Lipczensis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 Dilectis filiis rectori, magistris, doctoribus et universitati studii Lipczensis}}\plain \f3\fs24 . Per ea, que nobis prudenter et accurate exposuistis, studium atque diligenciam venerabilium fratrum et dilectorum filiorum sacri Romani imperii electorum ad extinguendum exortas in dei ecclesia dissensiones ... - ... quod per nos pax et unitas ecclesie non deficit, protestamur. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Hofmann (Hg.), Epistolae pontificae de rebus in Concilo Florentino annis 1438-1439 gestis (s. o.), Rom 1940, Nr. 141, S. 35f.; Bruno St\u252 \'fcbel (Hg.), Urkundenbuch der Universit\u228 \'e4t Leipzig von 1409 bis 1555 (CDS II 11), Leipzig 1879, Nr. 25, S. 35f. (nach dieser Hs.).  }

