\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1ra-rb) [Prolog:] [X]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [f\u252 \'fcr: Christus?] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 omnipotens deus, creator pius, sol iusticie, excelus ac adiutor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... mihi tribuat in presenti, in qua mea gradus est prolixitas et ad eam aquirenda non modica est dificultas ... quod omnes reperio Tadeum Florentinum et Petrum Paduanensem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (s. o. Geschichte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... cuncta felicitas. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1rb-114vb) [Text:] [Quaestio 1:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iuxta medium prohemiale tactum queritur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , utrum medico necessarium sit in omnibus speculatiuis scienciis esse edoctum. Primo uidetur quod non ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1vb) [Quaestio 2:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur, utrum medicina sit sciencia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (2ra) [Quaestio 3:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur, utrum medicina sit theorica uel practica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...  - ... et ita intelligeit Auicenna. Deo gracias peragamus infinitas. Conplecte fuerunt hec questiones per me Pacem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oder Parem?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  physicum de Baxano in uigilia sancti Michaelis archangeli currente M\u176 \'b0 3\u176 \'b0 lxvi\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [28.09.1366] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  114vb leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (115ra-118ra) Tabula Quaestionum, insgesamt 354 Quaestionen. 118rb sowie 118v-118v leer.}

