\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Regimen sanitatis<. >A<d habendum r\lquote m \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (remedium?) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 preseruatiuum corporis uestri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a lapsibus multimode contingentibus uestre caritatis laboriose aliqua compilaui. Et quia inter encia corpus humanum ... >De comestione<. >Q<uando affuerit desiderium comedendi tunc comestio non differatur ... >De ordine cibariorum<. >O<rdo cibariorum si habeatis plurima vercula ... - ... a predicto humore plenius posset expurgari etc.
